<%# 1回の処理: 左に だれ（黄の人 / 紫の係）と 何を頼んだか（青の命令）、右に 起きた出来事（オレンジ）と抜け（ピンク） %>
<li class="wall-beat<%= " is-caused" if beat.cause %>">
  <% if beat.cause %>
    <span class="wall-arrow-note">「<%= event_entry(beat.cause).label %>」が来たので</span>
  <% end %>
  <div class="wall-beat-body">
    <div class="wall-col">
      <% if beat.policy %>
        <div class="sticky sticky-policy" title="<%= beat.policy.rule %>">
          <span class="sticky-tag">方針・係</span>
          <strong><%= beat.policy.label %></strong>
          <small><%= beat.policy.rule %></small>
        </div>
      <% else %>
        <div class="sticky sticky-person">
          <span class="sticky-tag">人</span>
          <strong><%= wall_person(beat, generic:) %></strong>
        </div>
      <% end %>
      <div class="sticky sticky-command">
        <span class="sticky-tag">命令</span>
        <strong><%= beat.command %></strong>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="wall-col">
      <% wall_event_chunks(beat).each do |events| %>
        <% event = events.first %>
        <% entry = event_entry(event) %>
        <%= link_to event_viewer_event_path(event.event_id),
              class: [ "sticky", "sticky-event", kind_class(entry.kind), ("is-dim" unless events.any? { wall.highlighted?(it) }) ],
              title: entry.description do %>
          <span class="sticky-tag"><%= icon(entry.icon, size: 14) %><%= entry.kind_label %></span>
          <strong><%= entry.label %><% if events.size > 1 %> ×<%= events.size %><% end %></strong>
          <% unless generic %><small><%= event_summary(event) %></small><% end %>
        <% end %>
      <% end %>
      <% if beat.waiting %>
        <div class="sticky sticky-hotspot">
          <span class="sticky-tag"><%= icon(:alert, size: 14) %>流れの抜け</span>
          <strong><%= beat.waiting %></strong>
        </div>
      <% end %>
    </div>
  </div>
  <time class="wall-time" datetime="<%= beat.time.iso8601 %>"><%= event_time(beat.time) %></time>
</li>
